{"items":[{"id":"1684641901918244864","title":"我感觉我这段时间公号已经写的很温和了，…","content":"<p>我感觉我这段时间公号已经写的很温和了，但是还会被删。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;算了，还是写点别的吧。</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-a998e29d0b544ac26bc2a54116e8c854_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"997\" height=\"893\">","excerpt":"我感觉我这段时间公号已经写的很温和了，…","voteupCount":89,"commentCount":9,"created":1694429931,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1684641901918244864"},{"id":"1683107515796283392","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-94e0aabc23b504ca025bef1ae026948d_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"943\" height=\"275\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":169,"commentCount":8,"created":1694064102,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1683107515796283392"},{"id":"1682441883882852352","title":"我真的觉得这波瑞幸茅台敲中的点，可能正…","content":"<p>我真的觉得这波瑞幸茅台敲中的点，可能正好是经济下行周期的消费降级。</p>","excerpt":"我真的觉得这波瑞幸茅台敲中的点，可能正…","voteupCount":95,"commentCount":34,"created":1693905473,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1682441883882852352"},{"id":"1681775592515743744","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-a182701c7678d99cea303924fb2d66f1_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"812\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":97,"commentCount":12,"created":1693746547,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1681775592515743744"},{"id":"1681337040753479680","title":"跟俺爸出门，他说我开高速技术不行，他今…","content":"<p>跟俺爸出门，他说我开高速技术不行，他今天给我展现一下真正的技术，让我坐中间，好好看，好好听，好好学。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我心里：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;行吧，你说啥就是啥吧，还什么高速行车技术，我也开车这么久了，什么技术我没见过?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;结果还没上高速，就俩路口，我就眼睁睁看着我爸闯了一个红灯。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;……&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;讲真，这技术我真没见过。</p>","excerpt":"跟俺爸出门，他说我开高速技术不行，他今…","voteupCount":93,"commentCount":15,"created":1693642335,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1681337040753479680"},{"id":"1680943359370313728","title":"我这段时间在想一个事： 现在鼓励生育还…","content":"<p>我这段时间在想一个事：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;现在鼓励生育还是来得及的，因为你看到现在鼓励生育政策下的评论区，大家普遍认为的还是奖励少，还没有开始破防。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;这说明年轻人还是想生的，只是说迫于现实压力而没条件生。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;要再等等，真的把年轻人给逼绝望了，这些鼓励生育政策评论区下面就该是类似qnmd，这不是收“单身税”这类的批评了。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;真没多少时间了。</p>","excerpt":"我这段时间在想一个事： 现在鼓励生育还…","voteupCount":113,"commentCount":25,"created":1693548347,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1680943359370313728"},{"id":"1680637301494083585","title":"这个标题拉满了","content":"<p>这个标题拉满了</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-c7fd0f7adea3363d1cc2ff51ef64981f_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"690\">","excerpt":"这个标题拉满了","voteupCount":164,"commentCount":17,"created":1693475157,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1680637301494083585"},{"id":"1679264238416240640","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-814e5e08482c21c2ab5e19ee493ff06b_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"751\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":72,"commentCount":1,"created":1693147793,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1679264238416240640"},{"id":"1679169577886633984","title":"还是那个富哥们","content":"<p>还是那个富哥们。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我问他年龄这么大了不结婚只玩他妈妈不愁嘛？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;富哥们瞅了我一眼，说他给爸妈算了一笔账。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;他结婚，要买大house吧，按300平算，3年前，一平10w，也得3000来万吧。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;现在一平7万不到，三年下来省下接近一千万。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;再等等，不急着啥婚。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我：(=_=)</p>","excerpt":"还是那个富哥们","voteupCount":88,"commentCount":11,"created":1693125224,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1679169577886633984"},{"id":"1678828074479759360","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-9371db59d771f50f6b46278dd2dd3429_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"967\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":130,"commentCount":13,"created":1693043881,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1678828074479759360"}]}